WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000
Dear Adam Curry, this is Dawn
from the Dawn and Jericho, and I
wanted to talk to you about
something, but I don't know how
to bring it up, so I'm just
going to blurt it out.

00:15.000 --> 00:30.000
Okay, here we go. I noticed that
you didn't do anything for me
for sweetest day, and I thought
we had something, I thought we
had something special.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.000
And it hurt really bad.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.000
But then I started thinking,
Adam Curry wouldn't do that to
you, Dawn. Adam Curry's cool,
right? He wouldn't break your
heart.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
And so I came to the realization
that you were just waiting until
we were together at Blocker
Carm.

00:49.000 --> 00:57.000
And I know you're going to take
me out to dinner, and we're
going to have a fantastic time,
and maybe we'll even ride
mopeds.

00:57.000 --> 00:59.000
I'm sure it's going to be great.

00:59.000 --> 01:01.000
Hey, what are you doing over
there with my computer?

01:01.000 --> 01:03.000
What, Drew? Drew.

01:03.000 --> 01:05.000
What are you doing?

01:05.000 --> 01:06.000
Nothing.

01:06.000 --> 01:08.000
Are you sending a note to Adam
Curry?

01:08.000 --> 01:10.000
No.

01:10.000 --> 01:12.000
Hmm.

01:12.000 --> 01:14.000
Yes, yes I am.

01:14.000 --> 01:15.000
I knew it.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.000
You can't keep us apart.

01:16.000 --> 01:18.000
You're so busted.

01:18.000 --> 01:22.000
No, Adam. Goodbye.
